      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "The Hub keeps the Anthropic API key out of its own process environment through **credential scoping**: according to [[credential-scoping]], a local secrets loader reads the API key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it **only into the environment of the spawned child process** (either Ingest or Query agent) immediately before that process starts. The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated.\n\nThis design ensures that even if the Hub process itself is compromised or misbehaves, it cannot leak the credential simply by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually uses it to call the Anthropic API.",
